sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant API as HubWebController
    participant HubService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Planner as route-worker<br/>Planning Scheduler
    participant Builder as route-worker<br/>Build Scheduler
    participant Map as Kakao / Naver Map API
    participant Outbox as Outbox Publisher
    participant Kafka
    participant Shipping as 배송 서비스

    Client->>API: POST /api/v1/hubs
    API->>HubService: create(CreateHubCommand)
    HubService->>DB: 같은 트랜잭션<br/>Hub PENDING 저장<br/>RouteBuildJob READY 저장
    DB-->>HubService: commit
    HubService-->>API: HubRes(status=PENDING)
    API-->>Client: 201 Created

    Planner->>DB: READY Job 선점<br/>FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED<br/>READY → PLANNING
    Planner->>DB: 대상 계산<br/>양방향 Route skeleton JDBC Batch 저장
    Planner->>DB: PLANNING → RUNNING<br/>total / remaining counter 초기화

    Builder->>DB: Route Pair 2행 선점<br/>PENDING → PROCESSING<br/>processing token 기록
    Note over Builder,Map: 선점 트랜잭션 종료 후 외부 API 호출
    Builder->>Map: 거리·시간 조회
    Map-->>Builder: RouteWeight
    Builder->>DB: Route 2행 COMPLETE<br/>remaining_count 감소
    Builder->>DB: 최종 성공 시<br/>Job COMPLETE · Hub COMPLETE
    DB->>Outbox: BEFORE_COMMIT<br/>HubCreatedEvent 저장
    opt hub.route.events.enabled=true
        DB->>Outbox: HubRouteCreatedEvent 저장
    end
    DB-->>Builder: commit
    Outbox->>Kafka: AFTER_COMMIT 발행
    Kafka-->>Shipping: Hub/Route 변경 이벤트
    Shipping->>Shipping: 최단 경로 캐시 무효화

    alt 일시 오류
        Builder->>DB: Route PENDING<br/>next_retry_at + backoff
    else 최대 재시도 초과 또는 영구 오류
        Builder->>DB: Route FAILED<br/>failed_count 증가
        DB->>DB: Job FAILED · Hub FAILED
    end
